@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="container mt-5">
    <h1 class="mb-4">@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

    <p>
        Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy outlines how the Support Booking App collects, uses, stores, and protects your personal data.
    </p>

    <h4>What We Collect</h4>
    <ul>
        <li>Basic user information (name, email address) during registration or login</li>
        <li>Booking details including time slots, assigned engineers, and issue descriptions</li>
        <li>Email interaction data (e.g., confirmations, booking notifications)</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>How We Use Your Data</h4>
    <p>
        We use the information solely for the purpose of providing and managing support appointments:
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li>To assign engineers to support slots</li>
        <li>To send booking confirmation and reminder notifications</li>
        <li>To allow administrators and engineers to manage their schedules</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>Who Has Access</h4>
    <p>
        Access is limited to:
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li>You (as the account owner)</li>
        <li>Assigned engineers (only for relevant bookings)</li>
        <li>System administrators (for support and audit purposes)</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>Data Retention</h4>
    <p>
        Booking history and related user data are retained securely to support accountability and service delivery. You may request deletion of your account or specific records by contacting an administrator.
    </p>

    <h4>Cookies and Tracking</h4>
    <p>
        This app does not use third-party tracking. Session cookies may be used to maintain secure login sessions.
    </p>

    <h4>Your Rights</h4>
    <p>
        In accordance with applicable data protection laws (e.g., GDPR), you have the right to:
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li>Request access to your personal data</li>
        <li>Request correction or deletion of data</li>
        <li>Withdraw consent where applicable</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>Contact</h4>
    <p>
        For privacy-related inquiries, please contact the support administrator or system owner.
    </p>

    <hr />
    <p class="text-muted">
        This policy may be updated periodically. Continued use of the application constitutes your acceptance of the current version.
    </p>
</div>
